#. 何が…最後のヒントだよ…
#. 余計わからなくなっただけだ…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"How does that count as a hint? It just made me even\n"
"more confused...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それが…モノクマの狙いなのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is that what Monokuma was going for?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクを混乱させる為に、
#. モノクマが用意したねつ造写真…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did he put together a fake photo just to confuse\n"
"me...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、ねつ造とは思えないような、
#. 生々しさだったよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But it looked so real, so full of life. How could\n"
"anyone fake that...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じゃあ、やっぱり…
#. ボク以外のみんなは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which would mean...everyone but me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>直接…みんなに聞いてみよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I should just ask everyone directly.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうすれば…ハッキリするはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That should clear all this up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. いや、ハッキリさせるんだ！
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No...I HAVE to clear all this up!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. こんな物に構ってられるかッ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. I\n"
"can't waste my time with this...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. こんな物に構ってられるかッ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera... I can't waste my time with\n"
"this...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0013 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
